# PostHog — analytics for the four public pages. See src/analytics.ts.
#
# THIS FILE IS TRACKED ON PURPOSE, and the key below is not a secret. A PostHog project
# key is a WRITE-ONLY ingest token: it is compiled into the JS bundle that every visitor
# downloads, so it is public the moment the site is live, whatever this repo does. What it
# buys by being committed is that the live site cannot lose analytics to an environment
# variable someone forgot to set in a host's dashboard — a failure whose only symptom is a
# graph that stays at zero and looks like nobody visited.
#
# What must NEVER be committed is a PostHog PERSONAL API key (`phx_...`), which reads and
# writes the account over the REST API and is a real secret. This repo is PUBLIC.
#
# A shell/host environment variable of the same name overrides these.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_qodVmRXahuVJQBjiHXyBeQbNEkdPbmeG4YH8zKMbRn3L

# Cloud region. `https://eu.i.posthog.com` for an EU project — the wrong host drops every
# event silently, so confirm which one you log into before trusting an empty dashboard.
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
